# Audits Literature

Before creating or retaining U, apply the [common content decision](../../../framework/rules/records.md#substantive-material-retention), then source-unit obligations.
Preserve the actual inspected edition/passages, mathematics, applicability and uninspected-proof limits; acquisition-only facts stay at their source registry/intake homes.
Follow the [kind-specific rules](../../../framework/rules/literature-audits.md#organization-and-stable-units).

See the [current index](index.md) and [framework rules](../../../framework/readme.md).
